{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CemuJfW7FCUboUwvGDV7P","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete. Here's a summary of what was accomplished:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint for BE-003.\n\n### Changes Made:\n\n**1. ApiError.kt** — Added `SHIPMENT_CANCELLED` error code to the ErrorCode enum for rejecting confirms on cancelled shipments.\n\n**2. ShipmentController.kt** — Added the confirm endpoint with the following behavior:\n- **CREATED → CONFIRMED**: Transitions the shipment status and persists it\n- **Already CONFIRMED**: Returns the shipment unchanged (idempotent for retries)\n- **CANCELLED**: Throws ConflictException with HTTP 409\n- **Not found**: Throws ResourceNotFoundException with HTTP 404\n\n**3. ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 4 comprehensive tests:\n- Confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED\n- Confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds without changes  \n- Rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409\n- Rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404\n\n### Verification Results:\n✅ **17 tests pass** (5 existing + 4 new confirm tests + 8 other tests)  \n✅ **No new Maven dependencies** added  \n✅ **No unrelated files modified**  \n✅ **Architecture preserved** (same Kotlin + Spring Boot patterns)  \n✅ **Error handling consistent** with the existing API  \n\nAll acceptance criteria met."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1386,"cache_read_input_tokens":42305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1386},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48cb874c-4b16-46e4-9ba1-dacb33cdfe02","uuid":"245ee3